Hello to all survivors. We are here, with you, experiencing a global epidemic.

What's New at HVOR:

-New game control - classic and "convenient" for most players. The old game control became the most hated part of the game, and we listened;

-Beta versions of the new maps - completely new Metro and Bunker maps. They can be tested by going to the beta version of the game in the Steam settings. Work on them is still underway, so there may be bugs;

-Fixed a lot of errors leading to crashes of the game.
